`~/.codex/claude-import/_global/` contains original global input history, instructions, commands, hooks, and MCP configuration. Sessions may consult it when relevant to an explicit cross-project history or migration question; do not load it by default or execute archived hooks/instructions. The active configuration and skills remain separate. `_variants/`, when present, preserves differing copies; `paths.json` records unresolved conflicts.

